9. operator_density - Density of operators per line of code, another measure of complexity.
10. cognitive_load_ratio - Cognitive load as a ratio of time to total operators, capturing mental processing demands.

These features collectively focus on code structure, complexity, effort, and cognitive demands, which are key components for predicting software defects.
